  "details": "since the recent update (build 1004) any 3.0 avatars that have animations which affect sounds and/or particle systems break and repeat themselves consistently whenever a new animation state is played, this can be either you moving your fingers on index, changing your gesture, and even locomotion based animations like crouching and jumping.\nbasically any time a new state is played all other states seem to reset and replay again. \nthis still happens when \"write defaults\" is either disabled or enabled in all animation states, this also still happens when the animation is only 1 frame long",
